{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54780","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星坠地，鸣下似雷声。\n着把（辛本、川本作「地」）更（辛本、川本作「便」）如焚薪状，此爲天狗食人民。\n百日见灾生。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}